	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/video_settings/prism/enhanced/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Sky: the sky lights each place by how much of it the place sees: open ground fully, under cover less, a room with no sky only by what comes in. Flat: the game's own fill, the same everywhere."/>
		<string text="How the light meets the surfaces. Game Shaders: the lightmaps' light under the game's own textures, highlights and reflections. PRISM Materials: PRISM's materials alone."/>
		<string text="How characters, vehicles and weapons are lit. Baked: by the baked light where they are. Never Darker: the baked light, but never darker than Classic lit them."/>
		<string text="Enhanced: plasma bolts and needles light their surroundings too, each with a glow, and a muzzle flash lights your own weapon. Classic: only the lights the Xbox had.|Classic for everyone in a Pro 2v2 game; yours again after it."/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Traces the moving objects' sun shadows and the shapes below with the graphics card's ray tracing. Off: the game's own object shadows. Only where the graphics card traces rays."/>
		<string text="The sun's shadows of vehicles, characters and weapons. Traced: on the ground, on each other and on themselves. Classic: the game's own, on the ground only."/>
		<string text="The soft shade vehicles, characters and weapons cast about them: under a Warthog, at a Marine's feet, in their own creases. Traced: by ray tracing, as Path Traced shades them. Off: none."/>
		<string text="Shadows of the flashlight, muzzle flashes, plasma and the other lights, cast by the level and, while ray tracing is on, by characters and vehicles, which then also shadow the level's lamps."/>
		<string text="How sharp the game's own object shadows are, drawn while Object Shadows are Classic or ray tracing is off."/>
		<string text="The objects' shapes traced. As Drawn: the remodels as drawn, within 40 units. Game's: the game's own models, cheaper."/>
		<string text="Keeps each object's traced shape from frame to frame, refitting only what moved: much less work."/>
		<string text="The moving objects' leaves, fences and grates cast shadows through their holes. The level's are in the lightmaps."/>
	</strings>
</menus>
